# Normalise line endings for every text file in the repository.
#
# Without this, the same file content checks out with CRLF on Windows and LF
# everywhere else, so identical changes produce different diffs per machine.
# `text=auto` lets git detect binary content, and `eol=lf` pins what lands in
# the working tree. Locked by tests/test_repo_contracts.py.
* text=auto eol=lf
